{# ── Chapter: Takeaway ── #}
<section class="case-chapter" data-chapter="takeaway">
  <h2>Remember</h2>
  <div class="case-takeaway">
    <h3>Key takeaways</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="tone-junior">Animating top/left forces the browser to recalculate layout every frame — animating transform instead lets it skip that work entirely.</div>
        <div class="tone-mid">FLIP: measure First, let the DOM jump to Last, Invert with a transform so it looks unmoved, then Play by removing the transform with a transition.</div>
        <div class="tone-staff">Batch all First measurements before mutating the DOM and all Last measurements after, to avoid layout thrashing on longer lists.</div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
